    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"GrandpaStory.cs.12026","source":"...and for my very special grandson:","translation":"……還有，給我最特別的孫子："},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"GrandpaStory.cs.12028","source":"...and for my very special granddaughter:","translation":"……還有，給我最特別的孫女："},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"GrandpaStory.cs.12029","source":"I want you to have this sealed envelope.","translation":"我想把這封密封的信交給你。"},
